00:01:18.720 --> 00:01:20.180
TURNS!

00:01:22.720 --> 00:01:24.500
<i>Lieutenant Harry's Gold SUMO...</i>

00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:28.500
<i>...eliminated any of the remaining Mobile Suit Forces which the Ghingnham fleet had left behind.</i>

00:01:29.310 --> 00:01:32.400
<i>This was something that only the Royal Guard could have pulled off.</i>

00:01:33.600 --> 00:01:37.600
<i>Because of his efforts, Queen Dianna was successfully able to venture on a course back to the earth.</i>

00:01:37.610 --> 00:01:40.800
<i>I too am going to return with the Core Fighter...</i>

00:01:41.780 --> 00:01:43.830
<i>...in order to retrieve the Turn A's body.</i>

00:01:47.750 --> 00:01:51.750
<b>Ghingnham's Invasion</b>

00:02:09.300 --> 00:02:12.000
Man, there's quite a bit of aerodynamic drag to deal with down here.

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:14.600
Oh well, It won't stop me from blowing things up!

00:02:30.100 --> 00:02:33.000
These Earth troops are totally worthless!

00:02:33.630 --> 00:02:36.550
If you don't put up a better fight, I'll slip into a coma from boredom.

00:02:43.140 --> 00:02:44.930
They're even bombarding a place like this!?

00:02:47.640 --> 00:02:49.350
Are you planning on doing something, Keith?

00:02:49.350 --> 00:02:51.940
Well, I just needed a bit of air...

00:02:54.150 --> 00:02:55.650
Ma'am, we must run!

00:03:05.740 --> 00:03:09.460
Ma'am... are you alright? What's wrong!?

00:03:09.460 --> 00:03:10.750
It hurts...

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:12.460
No, it's blood. You're bleeding!

00:03:12.460 --> 00:03:16.460
Ghingnham's Mahiroo team? Why are you attacking Bellerine!?

00:03:19.550 --> 00:03:20.840
Damn it...

00:03:20.840 --> 00:03:23.340
There's no reason for you to be here on the earth!

00:03:23.840 --> 00:03:26.560
The Moonrace has no right to brutally assault those of the earth!

00:03:27.060 --> 00:03:29.930
I'll never forgive the Ghingnham Squad for what they're doing!

00:03:39.150 --> 00:03:41.030
Were they able to track us?

00:03:41.030 --> 00:03:44.660
Ghingnham's soldiers are currently too occupied by their assault on Ameria.

00:03:44.660 --> 00:03:46.660
They won't notice if we approach from this direction.

00:03:46.660 --> 00:03:51.460
- Okay. We'll approach from the eastern side of southern Ameria.
- Sir!

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:54.460
Did you get the Video of the South Pole?

00:03:54.960 --> 00:03:56.340
Enter.

00:03:56.750 --> 00:03:58.130
What matters did you wish to discuss?

00:03:58.130 --> 00:04:00.340
Well, this is something I didn't quite understand.

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:02.930
Why didn't we head directly for the continent of North Ameria...

00:04:02.930 --> 00:04:05.760
...but rather, flew southward and then headed north to get there?

00:04:05.760 --> 00:04:08.260
Ahh.. When one returns here from the moon...

00:04:08.260 --> 00:04:11.140
...the trip to either the North or South Pole will be about the same distance.

00:04:11.140 --> 00:04:15.150
It'd be easier for Ghingnham's fleet to find us if approached from the north.

00:04:15.230 --> 00:04:16.560
I see!

00:04:16.560 --> 00:04:20.030
So we didn't head there directly, but rather moved north from the South Pole to get there.

00:04:20.030 --> 00:04:21.740
Yes, That's correct.

00:04:21.740 --> 00:04:22.860
Please read this.

00:04:22.860 --> 00:04:23.950
Okay.

00:04:25.360 --> 00:04:27.160
The Antarctic Ocean...

00:04:27.160 --> 00:04:31.750
This is an application to request the unified assistance of all of North Ameria's leaders, right?

00:04:31.750 --> 00:04:33.040
That's right.

00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:35.960
If Sir Guin and Gym Ghingnham have formed their own alliance, then...

00:04:35.960 --> 00:04:39.460
...it will be necessary for us to form a powerful enough opposition to resist them.

00:04:39.460 --> 00:04:40.550
Yes.

00:04:40.550 --> 00:04:43.050
And, I would like to request something of you, Kihel Heim.

00:04:43.050 --> 00:04:44.130
Yes?

00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:47.760
This letter will also need to have Queen Dianna Soriel's signature.

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:49.260
Queen Dianna's...?

00:04:49.260 --> 00:04:52.930
I'm not asking you to give me a forged signature, or anything.

00:04:52.930 --> 00:04:56.730
I just want to request that the Queen of the Moon forms an Alliance with my father.

00:04:56.730 --> 00:04:58.650
To gain approval of the attack, right?

00:05:02.230 --> 00:05:04.240
Have you copied the data?

00:05:04.240 --> 00:05:06.530
Yes, but it's not complete.

00:05:06.530 --> 00:05:09.830
The combat data for the Turn A and the Turn X...

00:05:09.830 --> 00:05:12.540
Can that be copied, as well?

00:05:12.540 --> 00:05:15.160
What? Can we make a copy of the Turn A?

00:05:15.160 --> 00:05:18.130
No, it's nothing like that! That'd be terrifying.

00:05:18.130 --> 00:05:22.630
Say, does the White Doll's marking have anything to do with the legends?

00:05:22.630 --> 00:05:27.430
I've heard some say that when the era of space weapons and vehicles returns again...

00:05:27.430 --> 00:05:33.560
...The White Doll would reawaken and destroy earth's civilization again. What do you think?

00:05:33.560 --> 00:05:37.560
Well, we still need to research that facility you found underneath Vicinity if you want answers.

00:05:37.640 --> 00:05:39.150
At any rate...

00:05:39.150 --> 00:05:43.030
The Whales may have to conduct an attack near Vicinity.

00:05:43.030 --> 00:05:44.440
That's correct.

00:05:44.440 --> 00:05:47.450
- Vicinity?
- We can return there!?

00:05:48.360 --> 00:05:52.240
For those of us in the Jalopy Team, this job keeps getting worse.

00:05:52.240 --> 00:05:54.750
It took us so long to create a factory to produce mechanical dolls...

00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:57.040
...and now, just like that, it's completely gone!

00:05:57.040 --> 00:06:01.040
Commander Mallygan's division didn't suffer any casualties at all, did it?

00:06:01.040 --> 00:06:02.840
The Commander's division?

00:06:02.840 --> 00:06:04.840
Where was the Commander's division?

00:06:04.840 --> 00:06:06.920
They should be heading towards Fort Bolderlone.

00:06:06.920 --> 00:06:09.640
There was a weapons storehouse located around northern Luzianna.

00:06:09.640 --> 00:06:10.760
Let's go!

00:06:10.760 --> 00:06:11.850
Thank you so much!

00:06:11.850 --> 00:06:13.850
There's no need to worry about it.

00:06:18.230 --> 00:06:20.150
Damned Moonrace...

00:06:20.150 --> 00:06:23.440
I'm sorry. I won't be able to help you out here now.

00:06:23.440 --> 00:06:25.440
What are you talking about?

00:06:25.440 --> 00:06:28.450
The doctor said you'll make a recovery and walk again, but don't push yourself.

00:06:28.450 --> 00:06:30.950
Just relax.

00:06:30.950 --> 00:06:35.950
Sure! Say, once I've recovered, can we go and visit Grandmother?

00:06:36.440 --> 00:06:38.960
Of course. I'd also like to meet her.

00:06:47.130 --> 00:06:48.630
What are we going to do?

00:06:48.630 --> 00:06:51.140
Compared to those whose purpose in life is fighting...

00:06:51.140 --> 00:06:54.260
I don't have enough power to do anything!

00:07:04.440 --> 00:07:05.440
Pull!

00:07:06.530 --> 00:07:08.360
What're you people...!

00:07:11.860 --> 00:07:13.660
To modernize the industries?

00:07:13.660 --> 00:07:14.950
That's right.

00:07:14.950 --> 00:07:15.950
What I would like...

00:07:15.950 --> 00:07:21.330
...Is to acquire the assistance of the Moonrace technicians employed by Keith's bakery.

00:07:21.330 --> 00:07:23.130
I don't believe this...

00:07:23.130 --> 00:07:24.750
The reason that Ghingnham and I have returned...

00:07:24.750 --> 00:07:29.130
...is to quickly put an end to this battle between Dianna Counter and the Militia.

00:07:29.130 --> 00:07:32.260
Did Queen Dianna give you that order?

00:07:32.260 --> 00:07:35.550
Is there something you find odd, Keith?

00:07:35.550 --> 00:07:42.140
Do you have some issue with my request after I granted you the technicians to assist with your own machinery?

00:07:42.140 --> 00:07:46.150
Are you aware of what Ghingnham's forces have been doing since they arrived on earth?

00:07:46.360 --> 00:07:48.530
I intend to look into it.

00:07:48.530 --> 00:07:51.740
At this moment they are putting pressure on each of the Capital cities.

00:08:23.640 --> 00:08:25.940
Duke Borjarno, head for your vehicle!

00:08:28.860 --> 00:08:30.530
I'm fine...

00:08:30.530 --> 00:08:32.030
We're leaving!

00:08:33.860 --> 00:08:35.660
Erizona, This is Borjarno!

00:08:35.660 --> 00:08:38.030
Luzianna is now under an air raid attack from a group of mechanical dolls!

00:08:41.250 --> 00:08:42.960
They've come here from the moon!

00:08:42.960 --> 00:08:44.750
Those aren't birds!

00:08:48.840 --> 00:08:50.250
Don't counterattack!

00:08:50.250 --> 00:08:53.920
However, we of Erizona are NOT going to surrender. For now, simply observe them.

00:08:53.920 --> 00:08:56.840
Floria's Myani has been subdued.

00:08:56.840 --> 00:08:58.260
Main Forces, did you copy that?

00:08:58.260 --> 00:09:00.060
Myani has been subdued.

00:09:00.060 --> 00:09:03.060
We've also taken Sealaga of Carbania's territory.

00:09:03.060 --> 00:09:06.650
I repeat, we've successfully overtaken Carbania's Sealaga!

00:09:08.560 --> 00:09:11.020
What did you see while you were on the moon?

00:09:11.020 --> 00:09:13.360
I saw the future of Earth's people.

00:09:13.360 --> 00:09:16.360
After learning what I did from the Dark History, I have no doubt of this.

00:09:18.240 --> 00:09:19.950
Ya know, I've been thinking...

00:09:19.950 --> 00:09:21.830
You have a funny looking face!

00:09:21.830 --> 00:09:23.330
Thanks...

00:09:23.330 --> 00:09:25.960
Well, you'll have to give me more time to consider this.

00:09:28.250 --> 00:09:32.130
So after reaching the Moon, he decided to return with Ghingnham...

00:09:32.130 --> 00:09:33.960
It's quite a surprise.

00:09:33.960 --> 00:09:37.260
Yes. The noble heir was overtaken by the potential gains of a dictatorship.

00:09:37.260 --> 00:09:39.760
It's a shame.

00:09:41.930 --> 00:09:45.140
Guin Rhineford wants to go and make himself a warlord, does he?

00:09:45.140 --> 00:09:47.230
Let me tell you something, Merrybell...

00:09:47.230 --> 00:09:52.940
There's a way to use war to win over the people's hearts. I'd like to show your General that concept.

00:09:52.940 --> 00:09:56.240
Weren't you the one who told Ghingnham to come to earth in the first place?

00:09:56.240 --> 00:10:01.030
I already told you, my only true goal is to help the oppressed populous.

00:10:01.030 --> 00:10:04.330
Have you heard of the story of Icarus and the Sun?

00:10:04.330 --> 00:10:06.040
It's just a fairy tale.

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:07.750
Correct, however, the truth can be cruel.

00:10:07.750 --> 00:10:09.830
Dangerous or not, man will always be attracted to the sun.

00:10:12.460 --> 00:10:15.340
This rich brat is little more than a fool...

00:10:20.050 --> 00:10:22.260
Are the Militia soldiers on the move for something?

00:10:23.640 --> 00:10:26.730
Will we find Moonrace technicians in a place like this?

00:10:26.730 --> 00:10:31.940
If we're going to hide in a fortress, we should rebuild our forces and counter them with a taste of their own medicine.

00:10:32.440 --> 00:10:34.150
Yo, Chief Keith, how's it going?

00:10:34.150 --> 00:10:37.240
How did you end up piloting that mechanical doll?

00:10:37.240 --> 00:10:39.450
What was with that airship a bit ago?

00:10:39.450 --> 00:10:41.870
They just came for some of our bread.

00:10:42.530 --> 00:10:46.540
Hey, could you possibly tell us anything about Ghingnham's mechanical dolls?

00:10:46.750 --> 00:10:50.460
Tell us whatever you know. If you're from the Moonrace, that could help us out.

00:10:50.460 --> 00:10:53.250
Fran told us that you might be able to help, Keith Laijie.

00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:55.250
Fran told you... You're...

00:10:55.250 --> 00:11:00.430
You are one of the Moonrace's people, right? You appear to have technical knowledge.

00:11:07.060 --> 00:11:09.730
- That wouldn't be the wind.
- It's not wind.

00:11:09.730 --> 00:11:12.440
I wish they could keep it down...

00:11:18.240 --> 00:11:19.860
That's an Almaiya class' hull...

00:11:19.860 --> 00:11:20.700
Could that be...?

00:11:32.080 --> 00:11:34.660
Jo..Joseph, defend us!

00:11:34.660 --> 00:11:35.840
There's no need for that.

00:11:40.170 --> 00:11:42.690
If they were our enemy, they would've attacked us by now!

00:11:42.690 --> 00:11:43.010
Right...

00:11:51.270 --> 00:11:52.270
Moonrace?

00:11:52.270 --> 00:11:54.400
Oh wow, if it isn't Joseph!

00:11:54.400 --> 00:11:56.400
F...Fran!

00:11:56.400 --> 00:11:58.190
And you're the first person I see!

00:11:58.190 --> 00:12:00.570
Fran, what's going on here!?

00:12:00.570 --> 00:12:02.400
You guys!

00:12:02.400 --> 00:12:06.280
Commander Mallygan, John of The Suicide Team has returned!

00:12:06.280 --> 00:12:09.290
As have I, Ames! We've now returned from the Moon!

00:12:09.700 --> 00:12:13.710
Did you truly walk on the same Moon which floats in our skies!?

00:12:13.710 --> 00:12:19.000
The girls there are gorgeous, the food was excellent, and we were with Lady Lily Borjarno!

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:20.510
The Princess was there!?

00:12:20.510 --> 00:12:25.890
Thank you for waiting in the middle of nowhere to welcome us back from our trip, Mallygan.

00:12:25.890 --> 00:12:28.810
You and Fran both went back home?

00:12:28.810 --> 00:12:30.100
Don't be angry.

00:12:30.100 --> 00:12:31.180
Are you tired?

00:12:31.180 --> 00:12:33.600
Keith, I'm sorry we must impose on you again.

00:12:33.600 --> 00:12:36.610
Perhaps, Lady Kihel and Your Highness, it'd best if you both stay with the ship.

00:12:36.610 --> 00:12:37.900
I see...

00:12:37.900 --> 00:12:42.280
Oh wow, Queen Dianna! She said farewell to me as I was leaving for Earth...

00:12:42.280 --> 00:12:44.400
I can't believe she still remembers my name!

00:12:44.400 --> 00:12:47.870
Well, that's because we're the ones they selected to land here first, right?

00:12:54.210 --> 00:12:58.790
You did tell Queen Dianna that this is a neutral area, right?

00:12:58.790 --> 00:13:01.300
I did. Lord Guin has come through here as well.

00:13:01.300 --> 00:13:03.010
This will be just as quick.

00:13:03.010 --> 00:13:08.090
However, if we destroy the Turn A, it'll no longer be a threat to us, right, Lieutenant?

00:13:08.090 --> 00:13:09.810
The problem is how we hold out until then.

00:13:09.810 --> 00:13:11.970
It just may not be possible.

00:13:11.970 --> 00:13:13.680
This is difficult to accept...

00:13:13.680 --> 00:13:17.100
Queen Dianna Soriel seriously intends to destroy it?

00:13:18.270 --> 00:13:20.690
The Whales has quite a lot of equipment...

00:13:20.690 --> 00:13:23.280
And given how quickly they're willing to cooperate with Luzianna...

00:13:23.280 --> 00:13:25.490
It appears we'll be heading for quite the war!

00:13:25.490 --> 00:13:28.910
That's natural when you consider that Lady Lily Borjarno is currently here with us.

00:13:28.910 --> 00:13:33.870
Well, our opponents invaded the places where the Militia and the Dianna Counter had been battling...

00:13:33.870 --> 00:13:35.500
...so it seemed inevitable.

00:13:35.500 --> 00:13:37.000
Your Majesty...

00:13:37.000 --> 00:13:40.590
We, the technicians who have just been hired by Guin...

00:13:40.590 --> 00:13:43.380
...will find out what he's up to.

00:13:43.380 --> 00:13:45.090
That's an excellent idea!

00:13:45.090 --> 00:13:46.590
Loran, you go as well.

00:13:46.590 --> 00:13:48.590
Pretend to be Laura and get close to him.

00:13:48.590 --> 00:13:52.310
Silly, I mean so you can go in and retake the Turn A.

00:13:52.310 --> 00:13:53.970
That's a terrible plan!

00:13:53.970 --> 00:13:55.680
I think it's a good idea...

00:13:55.680 --> 00:13:57.100
The Willgem has returned!

00:13:57.100 --> 00:13:58.480
Has it!?

00:14:02.270 --> 00:14:04.990
I knew it, that's an Almaiya class ship down there!

00:14:04.990 --> 00:14:08.990
That means Queen Dianna has come after us!

00:14:09.200 --> 00:14:11.200
And treason carries the death sentence!

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:13.700
It didn't take them very long to come after us.

00:14:13.700 --> 00:14:15.870
Should we spread an anti-ship formation?

00:14:15.870 --> 00:14:18.790
Just tell the Mobile Suits to remain on standby.

00:14:18.790 --> 00:14:20.290
But, the enemy...!

00:14:20.290 --> 00:14:22.000
Don't worry so much.

00:14:24.590 --> 00:14:25.510
Here we go!

00:14:26.590 --> 00:14:28.970
The Earthlings on Willgem have no desire to fight...

00:14:28.970 --> 00:14:30.970
We just can't trust them...

00:14:30.970 --> 00:14:34.100
I'll simply need to hand the Turn A over to Gym Ghingnham.

00:14:36.470 --> 00:14:42.270
It is rather unfortunate, but I've heard that the whereabouts of Lily's father, Duke Borjarno, are now currently unknown.

00:14:42.980 --> 00:14:45.480
Lady, Please use this Mic!

00:14:45.480 --> 00:14:46.990
Thank you.

00:14:48.190 --> 00:14:53.990
Sir Guin, the fact that my father's whereabouts remain unknown only prove that he is currently still alive.

00:14:53.990 --> 00:14:59.080
He, along with the rest of North Ameria, have decided to ally with Dianna Soriel.

00:14:59.080 --> 00:15:02.380
Sir Guin, I assume you should perfectly understand why.

00:15:02.380 --> 00:15:05.170
I thank you for your confidence in me...

00:15:05.170 --> 00:15:10.090
But it seems as though you've become a hostile party towards us.

00:15:11.800 --> 00:15:13.180
I am Dianna Soriel!

00:15:13.180 --> 00:15:14.390
Willgem...

00:15:14.390 --> 00:15:19.100
If the ship's namesake, Will Game, saw that ship, he'd be shocked and appalled by its ferocity.

00:15:20.190 --> 00:15:22.480
I also have something I'd like to ask Laura!

00:15:22.480 --> 00:15:26.480
Without the Turn A, how do you intend to fight back against General Ghingnham?

00:15:27.480 --> 00:15:30.070
So Guin Rhineford finally confessed his true thoughts.

00:15:30.780 --> 00:15:32.200
Sorry...

00:15:32.200 --> 00:15:34.490
Hand Laura over to me.

00:15:34.490 --> 00:15:37.080
My intentions are not as you understand them to be!

00:15:37.080 --> 00:15:39.700
Please hand the Willgem over to Queen Dianna at once!

00:15:39.700 --> 00:15:42.290
What? Laura!

00:15:42.290 --> 00:15:45.670
That ship WAS the one uncovered by Mr. Will Game himself!

00:15:48.590 --> 00:15:50.010
Forgive me, please.

00:15:50.510 --> 00:15:51.800
I'll come with you, as well.

00:15:53.970 --> 00:15:57.470
The use of military force can never make people happy!

00:15:57.470 --> 00:16:00.890
The only thing you can succeed in doing will be repeating the Dark History!

00:16:00.890 --> 00:16:04.690
Am I such a fool then, Miss Dianna or Kihel?

00:16:04.690 --> 00:16:07.110
Please abandoned your alliance with Gym Ghingnham!

00:16:07.110 --> 00:16:10.990
Then can you accept that life here on earth is over a millennium behind life on the moon?

00:16:12.700 --> 00:16:14.070
You don't understand at all...

00:16:17.580 --> 00:16:21.370
That's enough, he fled! Joseph, launch the Jalopy team!

00:16:29.590 --> 00:16:31.170
Mallygan and Joseph?

00:16:31.170 --> 00:16:33.090
Consider your position at least a bit...

00:16:33.470 --> 00:16:34.300
Loran...

00:16:34.300 --> 00:16:38.100
Mr. John... Please hold them off until Her Majesty has made it safely away from here!

00:16:38.100 --> 00:16:41.600
That's my plan, but we'll be screwed if they attack us head on.

00:16:42.480 --> 00:16:43.690
That ringing...

00:16:45.480 --> 00:16:46.900
Sounds like a bell...

00:16:47.610 --> 00:16:49.480
Whales, Condorafto!

00:16:54.070 --> 00:16:56.570
Just the other day we were protecting that ship with our lives!

00:16:56.570 --> 00:16:58.070
And now we have to destroy it!

00:16:58.070 --> 00:16:59.490
Are we waiting for Queen Dianna?

00:16:59.490 --> 00:17:01.490
You got it.

00:17:04.790 --> 00:17:06.500
- Are we going the right way?
- Seems that way.

00:17:06.500 --> 00:17:09.170
Do they intend to fight on the other side of the river?

00:17:09.170 --> 00:17:11.670
Regardless, those fields are going to be destroyed.

00:17:11.670 --> 00:17:14.380
Is Queen Dianna in that car?

00:17:14.380 --> 00:17:16.470
How's Ms. Bellerine holding up in there?

00:17:16.470 --> 00:17:19.390
Lady Lily is worried about you.

00:17:19.390 --> 00:17:20.470
Are you doing okay?

00:17:20.470 --> 00:17:21.810
Thank you...

00:17:21.810 --> 00:17:24.680
Once I get used to all this shaking, I'll be fine.

00:17:26.600 --> 00:17:28.770
Sorry about this, Mr. Condorafto.

00:17:29.270 --> 00:17:31.480
They're fighting with Mobile Suits on the other end.

00:17:31.480 --> 00:17:32.900
You should get out of here.
- Sure.

00:17:37.410 --> 00:17:39.280
Make sure you defend the right side of the bridge as well!

00:17:40.700 --> 00:17:42.290
Merrybell, It's dangerous.

00:17:42.290 --> 00:17:45.000
Your naive way of doing things is no less dangerous!

00:17:45.870 --> 00:17:48.670
We can't afford to sit around and duke it out against mobile suits now.

00:17:48.670 --> 00:17:49.880
Understood?

00:17:51.380 --> 00:17:53.000
You're too slow!

00:17:56.090 --> 00:17:57.090
It stinks...

00:18:00.300 --> 00:18:03.100
Those bastards are using the Mustache against us!

00:18:03.100 --> 00:18:05.680
Jalopy Team, don't lose your resolve!

00:18:05.680 --> 00:18:11.110
The SUMOs will form up and protect the Whales. I, Queen Dianna am at 10 o'clock relative to the Whales...

00:18:11.110 --> 00:18:13.570
Loran, you should also retreat to the Whales.

00:18:15.570 --> 00:18:18.400
Position the turrets, and prepare the beam attack barriers!

00:18:18.400 --> 00:18:23.490
Take care of Queen Dianna and prepare for Anti-Mobile Suit combat!

00:18:27.290 --> 00:18:32.170
Loran, all Kapools, FLATs, and "Armadillos", gather together behind the Whales.

00:18:35.000 --> 00:18:37.090
Don't allow those mechanical dolls to enter the battle!

00:18:37.090 --> 00:18:40.970
I told them to return but they're claiming they can't hear my orders over the radio static!

00:18:40.970 --> 00:18:42.800
These Ghingnham officers...

00:18:46.680 --> 00:18:48.480
We can't stay on the defense forever!

00:18:48.480 --> 00:18:49.770
We'll have to fight back!

00:18:53.770 --> 00:18:55.070
Merrybell too!

00:18:55.070 --> 00:18:56.900
Tell the Mahiroo team to obey our orders!

00:18:56.900 --> 00:18:58.900
The enemy team doesn't look like it was prepared to assault us.

00:18:59.990 --> 00:19:01.280
Sochie! Miashei...

00:19:01.280 --> 00:19:04.870
...the cars on the left have both Ms. Bellerine and Queen Dianna in them.

00:19:04.870 --> 00:19:05.990
Roger!

00:19:05.990 --> 00:19:07.200
Sochie!

00:19:10.790 --> 00:19:12.290
You won't have a problem defeating the Mahiroo...

00:19:12.290 --> 00:19:14.090
Despite our warnings, they won't fall back!

00:19:24.970 --> 00:19:26.310
Lieutenant Harry...

00:19:26.970 --> 00:19:28.890
Hold on, this battle has begun!

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:33.480
Keith, can't you drive a bit more gently?

00:19:33.480 --> 00:19:35.400
It's okay, Miss Fran.

00:19:35.400 --> 00:19:38.070
Keith can't help it right now.

00:19:40.070 --> 00:19:41.700
We've stopped...?

00:19:41.700 --> 00:19:42.990
No.

00:19:42.990 --> 00:19:44.490
What's going on, Keith?

00:19:44.490 --> 00:19:46.080
The Kapool is going to give us a ride.

00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:47.870
You doing okay, Bellerine?

00:19:47.870 --> 00:19:51.210
I'm fine. At least I can still feel pain.

00:19:51.790 --> 00:19:53.290
Cent, don't fall!

00:19:55.790 --> 00:19:57.090
Inform the Willgem...

00:19:57.090 --> 00:20:00.170
Since you know how deadly the Ghingnham team can be, consider surrendering.

00:20:00.170 --> 00:20:01.880
Regarding the Turn A, we...

00:20:01.880 --> 00:20:05.090
The Turn A is attacking! Warn all the troops!

00:20:06.100 --> 00:20:07.680
Ready the Anti-Beam Beam!

00:20:07.680 --> 00:20:09.890
Willgem, pull out of here, or else you'll be hit.

00:20:13.190 --> 00:20:14.400
A warning?

00:20:15.270 --> 00:20:17.690
The Mohiroo and Willgem aren't doing anything useful!

00:20:18.190 --> 00:20:19.690
The cockpit?

00:20:20.900 --> 00:20:22.700
I'll aim for that cockpit!

00:20:25.780 --> 00:20:27.280
Anti-Beam Field!

00:20:32.210 --> 00:20:33.790
Everyone's... Where's Turn A?

00:20:41.880 --> 00:20:48.100
Merrybell, if you fire that Beam Rifle again, I'll snipe you from behind with the Mega Particle Cannon!

00:20:48.100 --> 00:20:50.470
You hear that, Merrybell?

00:20:51.890 --> 00:20:54.980
Looks like even rich brats have a temper sometimes.

00:20:54.980 --> 00:20:56.190
Roger!

00:20:56.190 --> 00:20:57.480
We're retreating.

00:20:57.480 --> 00:20:58.770
These people just don't get it...

00:20:58.770 --> 00:21:04.990
Whether we have a military government or not, we can't win without popular support. War isn't just a game...

00:21:04.990 --> 00:21:09.280
But in order to take on the remaining Dianna Counter forces, we need the Ghingnham team.

00:21:09.280 --> 00:21:10.370
That's correct.

00:21:15.790 --> 00:21:17.290
So it burned to the ground?

00:21:17.290 --> 00:21:19.590
I can't let Bellerine see this...

00:21:19.590 --> 00:21:22.170
Forgive me for my poor command decisions.

00:21:22.170 --> 00:21:23.510
No...

00:21:23.510 --> 00:21:26.680
I'm willing to join this battle now.

00:21:26.680 --> 00:21:28.970
I'll make it up to you, somehow.

00:21:29.470 --> 00:21:31.310
Keith, you can't fight in this war.

00:21:31.310 --> 00:21:35.770
That's right. Keith, continue your business to ensure this area remains neutral.

00:21:35.770 --> 00:21:37.900
Keep making your bread.

00:21:37.900 --> 00:21:39.610
Making my bread?

00:21:39.610 --> 00:21:41.980
Is that how I'm meant to fight?

00:21:43.070 --> 00:21:46.900
Besides, you need to stick around long enough to meet Bellerine's Grandmother.

00:21:47.570 --> 00:21:49.490
Regardless of whether it's on Earth, or on the moon...

00:21:49.490 --> 00:21:54.080
We must work hard to create a world everyone can peacefully live in.

00:21:54.080 --> 00:21:55.370
Therefore...

00:21:55.370 --> 00:21:57.500
Yes. I'll keep making my bread for everyone.

00:21:58.790 --> 00:22:01.090
We'll set up a plan to retrieve it?

00:22:01.090 --> 00:22:04.800
Well, Guin now has the Mustache, which is no laughing matter.

00:22:04.800 --> 00:22:06.670
Right, Uncle Sid?

00:22:06.670 --> 00:22:10.600
Yes. As things are, we don't have the strength to fight it.

00:22:10.600 --> 00:22:14.100
I suppose that's true. Then I'll have to reclaim the body of the Turn A.

00:22:30.870 --> 00:22:37.540
<b><i>Yama no ha tsuki wa michi</i></b>

00:22:30.870 --> 00:22:37.540
<b>As the full moon, casts itself over the mountain's edge...</b>

00:22:37.540 --> 00:22:44.590
<b><i>iki zuku anata no mori</i></b>

00:22:37.540 --> 00:22:44.590
<b>...it spreads the breath of life spreads into the forest where you stand...</b>

00:22:44.590 --> 00:22:51.720
<b><i>Natsu kusa abite nemuru</i></b>

00:22:44.590 --> 00:22:51.720
<b>As you sleep in the summer grass...</b>

00:22:51.760 --> 00:22:58.600
<b><i>Itooshii yokogao</i></b>

00:22:51.760 --> 00:22:58.600
<b>...your profile is a lovely sight to behold.</b>

00:23:00.850 --> 00:23:06.690
<b><i>Kaze ni</i></b>

00:23:00.850 --> 00:23:06.690
<b>The wind...</b>

00:23:06.690 --> 00:23:13.780
<b><i>LaLaLu... LaLaLu...</i></b>

00:23:13.780 --> 00:23:20.670
<b><i>utae... hane ni</i></b>

00:23:13.780 --> 00:23:20.670
<b>The sight of your wings, is seen...</b>

00:23:20.670 --> 00:23:25.170
<b><i>tsuki utsushi</i></b>

00:23:20.670 --> 00:23:25.170
<b>...in the moon's reflection.</b>

00:23:25.170 --> 00:23:32.800
<b><i>Inochi kagaya kase yo</i></b>

00:23:25.170 --> 00:23:32.800
<b>This wonderful life will shine vividly.</b>

00:23:40.370 --> 00:23:44.530
<i>Mr. Guin's reasoning and resolve remained unaffected by Joseph's actions.</i>

00:23:45.900 --> 00:23:47.670
<i>We're then left with no choice but to take it by force.</i>

00:23:49.320 --> 00:23:50.400
<i>Elsewhere...</i>

00:23:50.400 --> 00:23:56.120
<i>...as a result of the ongoing battle with Ghingnham's Military forces, Queen Dianna ends up forgiving Commander Phil.</i>

00:23:58.910 --> 00:24:01.210
<i>Next time... on </i>TURN A GUNDAM...

00:24:01.210 --> 00:24:02.920
<i>Dianna's Repatriation</i>

00:24:02.920 --> 00:24:06.500
"The wind cannot be stopped."

00:24:03.580 --> 00:24:08.460
<b>Dianna's Repatriation</b>
